  <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-800 mt-8 mb-4">Why Students Need Digital Drawing Tools</h2>
  <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">From biology diagrams to history timelines, visual learning helps students retain information better. Digital drawing tools offer advantages over paper: unlimited undo, easy sharing with classmates, and the ability to iterate quickly on ideas.</p>
  <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">The best tools for students are free, require no installation, and work on any device — including school Chromebooks and tablets.</p>

